        <mxCell id="NuVP0IwKT5pTPRl5Jx4h-51" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Important Notes&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Info&lt;/b&gt;: The &amp;lt;id&amp;gt; field in [erp_px_cat_g1v2] is only 5 characters, but they closely match the first 5 characters in &amp;lt;prd_key&amp;gt; in [crm_prd_info]. There is an assumption that these two tables can be related by adjusting the code.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Warning&lt;/b&gt;: As of this writing, &amp;lt;cid&amp;gt; in [erp_cust_az12] and &amp;lt;cst_id&amp;gt; in [crm_cust_info] shows zero matches between the two despite a similar pattern. This will need to be resolved in order to make a successful join/relationship.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
